2938 altı 4H zaman diliminde kapanış gelmesi sonrası düşüş yönlü hızlı ve negatif ayrışarak ilerledi (-%4.5). 

Short işlemi alsam da, long tarafta yeşil çizginin süpürülmesini beklediğim için, BTC yeni low atarken nearly equal lows yapıp yükseldi. Ben de hakkımı</span><button type="button" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-blue-500 text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> Show more</button></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 empty:hidden"><div class="relative overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-md" style="aspect-ratio:2.002933985330073"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/TheGunsslinger/status/2015716899540050284/photo/1"><img alt="" class="w-full" loading="lazy" width="4096" height="2045" src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_lDy36WIAAGk2D?format=webp&amp;name=medium" srcSet="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_lDy36WIAAGk2D?format=webp&amp;name=small 680w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_lDy36WIAAGk2D?format=webp&amp;name=medium 1200w, https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_lDy36WIAAGk2D?format=webp&amp;name=large 2048w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) calc(100vw - 80px), 600px"/></a></div><a aria-label="View media" class="absolute inset-0 z-10" href="/TheGunsslinger/status/2015716899540050284/photo/1"></a></div></div><div class="transition-colors focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-500 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-100/50" data-href="/TheGunsslinger/status/2015170711401398311" role="link" tabindex="0"><article data-tweet-id="2015170711401398311"><div class="flex gap-2 p-3 flex-row"><div class="w-24 shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden aspect-square border border-gray-200 rounded-md"><div class="relative h-full w-full"><div inert="" class="h-full w-full"><a aria-label="Image" class="block h-full w-full cursor-zoom-in appearance-none border-none bg-transparent p-0 text-inherit" href="/TheGunssling