__␀",u:1787000961087,s:"success",l:$R[3]={guideTrends:void 0},ssr:!0},$R[4]={i:"␀$username␀status␀$id␀␀Efloud␀status␀2015726334912389328␀{}",u:1787000961249,s:"success",l:$R[5]={conversationOptions:$R[6]={rankingMode:void 0},metadata:$R[7]={authorAvatarUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_normal.jpg",authorDescription:"Sup bro? \nMostly TA, rarely FA. \nAlways chill out. \nTweets are not financial/investment advice. \n15.09.1966",authorName:"Efloud",focalTweetId:"2015726334912389328",hasArticle:!1,headMetadata:$R[8]={appLinkUrl:"twitter://status?id=2015726334912389328",articleTags:void 0,author:$R[9]={image:$R[10]={alt:"Efloud profile picture",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg"},screenName:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},bodyText:"@TheGunsslinger Eline sağlık brom, gayet net bir analiz olmuş.\n\nBen de $BTC'de $85800-85300 bölgesine bir temas ile daha net bir market reversal gelebilir düşüncesindeydim. Her ne kadar $ETH destek olarak düşündüğüm bölgeden reaksiyon almış olsa bile bu sebeple bu paritede işlem alamadım.\n\nHer https://t.co/YYFzyJpYcl",canonicalPath:"/Efloud/status/2015726334912389328",canonicalUrl:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/2015726334912389328",description:"@TheGunsslinger Eline sağlık brom, gayet net bir analiz olmuş.\n\nBen de $BTC'de $85800-85300 bölgesine bir temas ile daha net bir market reversal gelebilir düşüncesindeydim. Her ne kadar $ETH destek olarak düşündüğüm bölgeden reaksiyon almış olsa bile bu sebeple bu paritede işlem alamadım.\n\nHer",faviconUrl:void 0,hasAiGeneratedMedia:void 0,image:$R[11]={alt:void 0,height:1858,isContent:!0,preloadUrl:"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_lL_G_WsAExmeW?format=webp&name=medium",url:"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/G_lL_G_WsAExmeW.jpg:large",width:3286},isAdult:!1,isArticle:!1,jsonLd:$R[12]=[$R[13]={"@context":"https://schema.org","@id":"https://x.com/i/status/2015726334912389328","@type":"SocialMediaPosting",author:$R[14]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"Efloud",identifier:"1063939505827323904",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2036249821804371969/QbSPb7JG_400x400.jpg",name:"Efloud",url:"https://x.com/Efloud"},comment:$R[15]=[$R[16]={"@id":"https://x.com/TheGunsslinger/status/2015727921273397673","@type":"Comment",author:$R[17]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"TheGunsslinger",identifier:"1777425517899067392",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1942218378048942080/0lfH0e6u_400x400.jpg",name:"The Gunslinger",url:"https://x.com/TheGunsslinger"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2026-01-26T10:06:01.000Z",identifier:"2015727921273397673",interactionStatistic:$R[18]=[$R[19]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/TheGunsslinger/status/2015727921273397673/likes",userInteractionCount:25},$R[20]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/TheGunsslinger/status/2015727921273397673/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[21]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[22]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:2445}],text:"@Efloud Teşekkürler brom hem feedback hem de analizlerin devamı niteliğinde chartların için. \n\nBTC tarafında seninle fiyat aralığı olarak benzer bir beklentideydim, ancak önemli bir likidite temizliği ve market yapısı değişimi sonrası retestini almak makul gözüktü. Ancak senin de"},$R[23]={"@id":"https://x.com/btcdharmaa/status/2015728921816231938","@type":"Comment",author:$R[24]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"btcdharmaa",identifier:"1683804740453380097",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1780579989911371777/bL6WlBNK_400x400.jpg",name:"odtulu ogrenci",url:"https://x.com/btcdharmaa"},commentCount:0,datePublished:"2026-01-26T10:10:00.000Z",identifier:"2015728921816231938",interactionStatistic:$R[25]=[$R[26]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/btcdharmaa/status/2015728921816231938/likes",userInteractionCount:1},$R[27]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/btcdharmaa/status/2015728921816231938/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[28]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:0},$R[29]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:34}],text:"@Efloud @TheGunsslinger"},$R[30]={"@id":"https://x.com/BkozTrades/status/2015732392770543881","@type":"Comment",author:$R[31]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"BkozTrades",identifier:"1250753183690915840",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1536824142363774978/b3nlFeAV_400x400.jpg",name:"Bkoz",url:"https://x.com/BkozTrades"},commentCount:1,datePublished:"2026-01-26T10:23:47.000Z",identifier:"2015732392770543881",interactionStatistic:$R[32]=[$R[33]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/BkozTrades/status/2015732392770543881/likes",userInteractionCount:6},$R[34]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/BkozTrades/status/2015732392770543881/retweets",userInteractionCount:0},$R[35]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:1},$R[36]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:498}],text:"@Efloud @TheGunsslinger Premium bir thread olmus burasi, elinize saglik broskis. Keyifli haftalar"}],commentCount:7,identifier:"2015726334912389328",interactionStatistic:$R[37]=[$R[38]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/LikeAction",name:"Likes",url:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/2015726334912389328/likes",userInteractionCount:158},$R[39]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ShareAction",name:"Retweets",url:"https://x.com/Efloud/status/2015726334912389328/retweets",userInteractionCount:6},$R[40]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ReplyAction",name:"Replies",userInteractionCount:7},$R[41]={"@type":"InteractionCounter",interactionType:"https://schema.org/ViewAction",name:"Views",userInteractionCount:11798}],parentItem:$R[42]={"@id":"https://x.com/TheGunsslinger/status/2015716899540050284","@type":"SocialMediaPosting",author:$R[43]={"@type":"Person",alternateName:"TheGunsslinger",identifier:"1777425517899067392",image:"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1942218378048942080/0lfH0e6u_400x400.jpg",name:"The Gunslinger",url:"https://x.com/TheGunsslinger"},datePublished:"2026-01-26T09:22:13.000Z",identifier:"2015716899540050284",text:"$ETH LTF Update\n\n2938 altı 4H zaman diliminde kapanış gelmesi sonrası düşüş yönlü hızlı ve negatif ayrışarak ilerledi (-%4.5). \n\nShort işlemi alsam da, long tarafta yeşil çizginin süpürülmesini beklediğim için, BTC yeni low atarken nearly equal lows yapıp yükseldi. Ben de hakkımı"},text:"@TheGunsslinger Eline sağlık brom, gayet net bir analiz olmuş.\n\nBen de $BTC'de $85800-85300 bölgesine bir temas ile daha net bir market reversal gelebilir düşüncesindeydim. Her ne kadar $ETH destek olarak düşündüğüm bölgeden reaksiyon almış olsa bile bu sebeple bu paritede işlem alamadım.\n\nHer"}],mediaPreviewImageUrl:"https://jf.x.com/images/media-preview/2015726334912389328",publishedTime:"2026-01-26T09:59:43.000Z",replyCount:7,socialTitle:"Efloud (@Efloud) on X",title:"Efloud on X: \"@TheGunsslinger Eline sağlık brom, gayet net bir analiz olmuş.\n\nBen de $BTC'de $85800-85300 bölgesine bir temas ile daha net bir market reversal gelebilir düşüncesindeydim. Her ne kadar $ETH destek olarak düşündüğüm bölgeden reaksiyon almış olsa bile bu sebeple bu paritede işlem alamadım.\n\nHer\""},replyCount:7,screenName:"Efloud",status:"available",text:"@TheGunsslinger Eline sağlık brom, gayet net bir analiz olmuş.\n\nBen de $BTC'de $85800-85300 bölgesine bir temas ile daha net bir market reversal gelebilir düşüncesindeydim. Her ne kadar $ETH destek olarak düşündüğüm bölgeden reaksiyon almış olsa bile bu sebeple bu paritede işlem alamadım.\n\nHer https://t.co/YYFzyJpYcl"},isSinglePost:!1},ssr:!0}],dehydratedData:$R[44]={relayRecords:$R[45]={"client:root":$R[46]={__id:"client:root",__typename:"__Root","threaded_conversation_with_injections_v2(focal_tweet_id:\"2015726334912389328\")":$R[47]={__ref:"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline"},"tweet_result_by_rest_id(rest_id:\"2015726334912389328\",safety_level:\"TweetDetail\")":$R[48]={__ref:"TweetResults:2015726334912389328"},"__threaded_conversation_with_injections_v2_urt(focal_tweet_id:\"2015726334912389328\")":$R[49]={__ref:"client:root:__threaded_conversation_with_injections_v2_urt(focal_tweet_id:\"2015726334912389328\")"}},"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline":$R[50]={__id:"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline",__typename:"TimelineTimeline",id:"LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline",response_objects:null,instructions:$R[51]={__refs:$R[52]=["client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:0","client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:1","client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:2","client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:3"]}},"client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:0":$R[53]={__id:"client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:0",__typename:"TimelineClearCache",retain_viewport_items:null},"client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:1":$R[54]={__id:"client:LoggedOutRepliesProduct-Timeline:instructions:1",__typename:"TimelineAddEntries",entries:$R[55]={__refs:$R[56]=["urt:server:TimelineTimelineEntry:tweet-2015716899540050284","urt:server:TimelineTimelineEntry:tweet-20157263349